6SJc7WIn3t","user":{"login":"MohsenHNSJ","id":97420292,"node_id":"U_kgDOBc6EBA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97420292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ","html_url":"https://github.com/MohsenHNSJ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T14:12:10Z","updated_at":"2025-11-30T14:12:10Z","body":"> I remember a similar issue being raised recently, where it turned out to be a GPU driver issue\n\nI have checked the Event viewer and found near 300 entries in a 5 second timeframe, just before the behavior, here are the warnings and errors:\n| Level | Date and Time | Source | Event ID | Task Category | Details |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Error | 11/30/2025 10:03:12 AM | Intel.GraphicsSoftware.App | 223 | (725) | {\"category\":\"Igcl\",\"level\":\"Error\",\"message\":\"3rd Party - IGCL ctlMemoryGetBandwidth - Exception\"} |\n| Error | 11/30/2025 10:03:12 AM | Intel.GraphicsSoftware.App | 222 | (725) | {\"category\":\"Igcl\",\"level\":\"Error\",\"message\":\"ctlMemoryGetBandwidth, result=1073741834\"} |\n| Error | 11/30/2025 10:03:12 AM | Intel.GraphicsSoftware.App | 200 | (725) | {\"category\":\"Igcl\",\"level\":\"Error\",\"message\":\"3rd Party - IGCL ctlEnumLeds - Exception\",\"parameters\":{\"result\":1073741834}} |\n| Error | 11/30/2025 10:03:12 AM | Intel.GraphicsSoftware.App | 199 | (725) | {\"category\":\"Igcl\",\"level\":\"Error\",\"message\":\"ctlEnumLeds, result=1073741834\"} |\n| Warning\t | 11/30/2025 10:03:11 AM | Intel.GraphicsSoftware.App | 41 | (31356) | {\"category\":\"PresentMonWrapper\",\"level\":\"Warning\",\"message\":\"PresentMonSession already tracking\",\"parameters\":{\"handle\":\"25F897AB080\",\"process\":0}} |\n | Warning | 11/30/2025 10:03:11 AM | Intel.GraphicsSoftware.App | 37 | (31356) | {\"category\":\"PresentMonWrapper\",\"level\":\"Warning\",\"message\":\"PresentMonSession not tracking\",\"parameters\":{\"handle\":\"25F897AB080\",\"process\":7400}} |\n\nI guess you are right. But why it only happens in Godot? I do video editing, heavy gaming (for this machine) and programming, none I had seen this behavior.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3592584685/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3596524254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113350#issuecomment-3596524254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113350","id":3596524254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WXpre","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-01T13:20:48Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T13:20:48Z","body":"Can you test with [4.6.dev4](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-6-dev-4/) to see if this occurs in 4.6.dev as well?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3596524254/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602430817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113350#issuecomment-3602430817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113350","id":3602430817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WuLth","user":{"login":"MohsenHNSJ","id":97420292,"node_id":"U_kgDOBc6EBA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97420292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ","html_url":"https://github.com/MohsenHNSJ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T14:48:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T14:48:47Z","body":"> Can you test with [4.6.dev4](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-6-dev-4/) to see if this occurs in 4.6.dev as well?\n\nI can confirm, this behavior is also seen in 4.6 dev4:\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1126\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee7f366f-d9e6-47bf-b960-b7c6221ecfd2\" />\n\nThe output log is about 1300 messages now (and growing) which is a repetition of the following lines:\n```\nERROR: platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp:4021 - Parameter \"hicon\" is null.\nERROR: platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp:4680 - Unexpected window message 0x82 received for window we cannot recognize in our collection; sequence error.\nERROR: Failed to create Windows OS window.\nERROR: Failed to create sub window.\nERROR: scene/main/window.cpp:669 - Condition \"window_id == DisplayServer::INVALID_WINDOW_ID\" is true.\nERROR: platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp:2005 - Condition \"!windows.has(p_window)\" is true. Returning: INVALID_SCREEN\n```\n\nBut, this time the event viewer do not have a warning or error in it.\n\nAlso, I found a more reliable way of re-creating this, which is in no way a representation of an actual user interaction but causes the crash to happen way sooner. I open Edge + Godot + VSCode and rapidly ALT + TAB between them ( like once every second) and after 1 or 2 minutes, I try to Run the project, in the second or third time, it crashes, roughly takes 5 or 6 minutes to do.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602430817/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3603050648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113350#issuecomment-3603050648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113350","id":3603050648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WwjCY","user":{"login":"MohsenHNSJ","id":97420292,"node_id":"U_kgDOBc6EBA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97420292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ","html_url":"https://github.com/MohsenHNSJ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohsenHNSJ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T16:56:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T16:56:56Z","body":"The problem also persists in a dual monitor setup. I tried Godot in main laptop window and VSCode in external monitor, by switching between them, without using ALT + TAB, the crash happens again.\n\nIt seems it's related to when Godot loses focus and regains focus.\n\nNo error or warning also appears in the event viewer for the past 3 crashes (twice in 4.6dev4 and now in 4.5.1).\nIf there is anything I can do to provide better information and clues about the root cause, I will be glad to help, as these crashes are happening more and more frequently, really a pain...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"